From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QED64 Toolchain <qed64-toolchain@localhost>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 10:35:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 15/22] build: use the multi-arch emsdk image

This PR drops the -arm64 suffix from the build image so the toolchain builds natively on both arm64 and amd64 hosts; the multi-arch tag resolves to the same image content per platform.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docker-wasm64/Dockerfile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/docker-wasm64/Dockerfile b/docker-wasm64/Dockerfile
index ff57c87..014c8fd 100644
--- a/docker-wasm64/Dockerfile
+++ b/docker-wasm64/Dockerfile
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-FROM emscripten/emsdk:6.0.5-arm64
+FROM emscripten/emsdk:6.0.5
 
 # Native stage0 needs the host libuv headers/library. The wasm stage builds its
 # own patched libuv through Emscripten.
